<%= @account.name %> paid for its own domain.

Requested domain: <%= @account.requested_custom_domain %>
Account: <%= AppDomain.marketing_url("/admin/accounts/#{@account.id}") %>

1. heroku domains:add <%= @account.requested_custom_domain %>
2. Send the mosque the DNS target Heroku shows (CNAME <%= @account.requested_custom_domain %> -> ....herokudns.com)
3. When DNS resolves, enter the domain as "Custom domain" in the admin panel.
